# Development Source Summary

Development is framed as a universal mental model for navigating complexity through pattern and relationship recognition. It is referenced in two of Carol S. Dweck's works: Mindset and Self-Theories: Their Role in Motivation, Personality, and Development. The source provides no substantive elaboration beyond naming the model and its applicability.
